const mobilePaymentProviders:{id:MobilePaymentProvider;label:string}[]=[{id:'bkash',label:'bKash'},{id:'nagad',label:'Nagad'},{id:'rocket',label:'Rocket'},{id:'upay',label:'Upay'}];
